T ThemeColour                           | Api/ThemeSpecification.h      | 28-32   | One interface colour: a coordinate carrying the space it is a coordinate in, plus the fraction it covers. colour whose space nothing states is the shape a transfer function is later added to "fix". Held as a `ColourSpecification` in the display space so the absence of any transfer inside `SlateUI` stays checkable. fraction over the interface's own recording, not a property of the colour — `36` carries no alpha for exactly that reason.
F Quantize                              | Api/ThemeSpecification.h      | 42      | Quantises one theme colour to the eight-bit-per-channel code the vendor draw surface accepts. Coordinates outside the unit interval are bounded here rather than wrapping, because a wrapped code is a colour the artist sees as a wrong hue rather than as a clipped one.
F Attenuate                             | Api/ThemeSpecification.h      | 50      | Returns one theme colour at a declared coverage, its coordinate untouched.
T ThemePalette                          | Api/ThemeSpecification.h      | 60-83   | Every colour the interface draws with, named by what it is drawn on rather than by its hue. literals. A component that spells a colour of its own is the defect this struct exists to prevent.
T LayoutExtents                         | Api/ThemeSpecification.h      | 95-111  | Every spacing, height and radius the interface lays out with, in interface pixels. of the other. Changing the density must not require an artist to re-author a colour. that answers it is folded in once by `ResolveActiveTheme` rather than multiplied at each read site.
T ThemeSpecification                    | Api/ThemeSpecification.h      | 120-124 | The palette and the extents together — what every present call is handed by const reference.
F DeclaredDarkPalette                   | Api/ThemeSpecification.h      | 135     | The built-in dark palette. `SlateUI` reads a field of the value this returns.
F DeclaredDefaultExtents                | Api/ThemeSpecification.h      | 140     | The built-in layout extents, before any density scale is folded in.
F ResolveActiveTheme                    | Api/ThemeSpecification.h      | 151     | Assembles the active theme and folds the declared density scale into the extents that carry pixels. multiplied at each read site is a scale one site forgets, and the artist sees one control that ignores it. give a label the whole row and leave the control nowhere to sit.
F Enforce                               | Api/ThemeSpecification.h      | 161     | Mirrors the theme into the interface library's own style, so a control drawn without the theme still matches. has made the vendor's global state the source of truth, which is the erosion `14` opens by describing.
